  "slug": "azure-aks-baseline",
  "title": "AKS production baseline",
  "description": "A private AKS cluster in its own spoke: Application Gateway with WAF is the only public entry and forwards to an internal load balancer in front of the ingress controller. System and user node pools are separated, images and secrets come from Container Registry and Key Vault over private endpoints, Cosmos DB is reached the same way, and every outbound flow leaves through Azure Firewall in the hub. Workload identity, Azure Policy, Defender for Containers and Container insights watch the cluster.",
